DSH adapter changes: native client mounting, scoped CSS, inline original logo,
local-library transport, namespaced persistence, header navigation and workflow controls.
The interface and common errors are localized into Simplified Chinese.
Graph geometry, interaction logic and the original styles.css are retained.
Middle-dot text separators are replaced at build time to follow the user's UI preference.

python/model_mode.py adapts analysis orchestration from skillnet-ai 0.1.5
(skillnet_ai/analyzer.py, MIT). Original prompts, schemas, evidence validation,
cache and snapshot publication are reused from the pinned SDK. Embedding-free
candidate generation and current-source routing are DSH adapter additions.

